[SIZE=4][B]Banking and saved characters[/B][/SIZE]
Native deposit and withdrawal actions are exercised against Rust. Earlier same-save login tests also checked saved bank and inventory state.

[SPOILER=Banking]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/server-openrune/02-bank-transfers.png[/IMG]
