[SIZE=4][B]Other implemented work[/B][/SIZE]
Other work with development or integration tests includes:
[LIST]
[*]Melee, ranged and elemental-spell rules; rune/ammunition checks, combat XP and prayer selection/drain.
[*]Cooking and baking, dough and pie assembly, gem cutting, glassblowing, pottery, jewellery, spinning, weaving and selected leatherwork.
[*]Equipment changes, NPC routing and dialogue, death/loot handling, item packs and selected use-item interactions.
[*]Shop transaction and stock rules. Broad world-shop registration is still incomplete.
[/LIST]
Next steps include broader native combat and loot tests.

