[SIZE=4][B]OpenRune migration and verification[/B][/SIZE]
We adapt OpenRune behavior to the existing Rust action, inventory and persistence systems, targeting revision 239.1. Wiki checks help resolve version and gameplay differences.

The ledger records each implementation and its registration. Independent verification uses pinned builds to check native actions, saved state and reference behavior. Current work includes recently ported scenery interactions and quest-specific spade Dig hooks.

